From b5a10ef110cb9c9f1f073d1a9c046d4ad7b084d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DByte308 <69403407+DByte308@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:00:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 11/13] Fix issues from an audit of the app

- Closing Preferences no longer drops Pimax page changes made meanwhile
  (e.g. a finished calibration); pages share one env map refreshed on close;
  the restart banner also shows for Preferences changes.
- Render resolution row edits the same render-scale preference as
  Preferences instead of a second env var with a different default.
- SLAM / controller tracking switches write explicit values (driver default
  depends on the lighthouse faceplate); lens distance is an override switch.
- Eye tracking: a recalibration is combined with the active correction
  (reported by the driver) instead of replacing it; Stop is not a failure;
  tools only run once the service is ready; partial calibration entries are
  not saved; a running tool is stopped when Envision quits.
- Developer mode hides the profile switch again; no second back button on
  Logs; Monado's spellings of false are understood.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
